import{_ as i,o as a,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 243 | Realm and History: The Realm Roots of Civilizational Decline and Correction","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 243 | Realm and History: The Realm Roots of Civilizational Decline and Correction","no":243,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","History","Civilizational Decline","Correction Mechanism"],"related":["71-Pre-Anchor Era","72-Anchor Awakening Epoch","04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0243_模块1-境界与历史-文明倒退的境界根源与纠错.md","filePath":"en/0243_模块1-境界与历史-文明倒退的境界根源与纠错.md"}'),o={name:"en/0243_模块1-境界与历史-文明倒退的境界根源与纠错.md"};function r(l,e,s,c,d,h){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-243-realm-and-history-the-realm-roots-of-civilizational-decline-and-correction" tabindex="-1">Entry 243 | Realm and History: The Realm Roots of Civilizational Decline and Correction <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-243-realm-and-history-the-realm-roots-of-civilizational-decline-and-correction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 243 | Realm and History: The Realm Roots of Civilizational Decline and Correction&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 71, 72, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-do-some-civilizations-go-backward-as-they-live-on" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Why do some civilizations go backward as they live on <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-do-some-civilizations-go-backward-as-they-live-on" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Why do some civilizations go backward as they live on&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Cosmos)&#39;s history, there are civilizations like the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization that continuously ascend, and also civilizations that once were glorious but ultimately declined or even collapsed. Civilizational decline is not a random event, but has deep roots at the realm level — when a civilization&#39;s cultivation system goes wrong, realm advancement no longer drives civilization progress, but instead causes class solidification and resource monopoly, and civilization will take the road of decline.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are directly embodied in the relationship between realm and history: the anti-predation axiom is the fundamental defense against civilizational decline; the republican axiom of Myriad Races is the institutional guarantee of civilization&#39;s continuous progress; the collective ascension axiom is the direction guarantee of civilization not declining; the causal self-discipline axiom ensures historical correction does not disturb existing karma; the law-first axiom ensures correction mechanisms&#39; law definitions are stable; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This entry analyzes the realm roots of civilizational decline, and the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s historical correction mechanisms.</p><h2 id="i-four-realm-roots-of-civilizational-decline" tabindex="-1">I. Four Realm Roots of Civilizational Decline <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-four-realm-roots-of-civilizational-decline" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Four Realm Roots of Civilizational Decline&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Decline Type</th><th>Realm-Level Root</th><th>Typical Manifestation</th><th>Historical Case</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Class-solidification type</td><td>High realm monopolizes cultivation resources</td><td>Bottom cannot advance, civilization talent dries up</td><td>Pre-Anchor era&#39;s sect system</td></tr><tr><td>Predation-inflation type</td><td>Cultivation system centered on predation</td><td>Energy circulation breaks, civilization foundation corrodes</td><td>Pre-Anchor era&#39;s predatory empires</td></tr><tr><td>Ceiling-lock type</td><td>Realm system sets artificial upper limit</td><td>After reaching upper limit civilization loses direction</td><td>Tang-Luo-style fierce-realm ceiling</td></tr><tr><td>Karma-imbalance type</td><td>High-realm operations disturb karma</td><td>Karma bursts, civilization collapses</td><td>Pre-Anchor era&#39;s plane wars</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-class-solidification-decline" tabindex="-1">II. Class-Solidification Decline <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-class-solidification-decline" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Class-Solidification Decline&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This is the most common civilizational decline mode. High-realm cultivators monopolize cultivation resources and methods; bottom beings cannot advance. The result:</p><ul><li>Civilization&#39;s talent pool gets smaller and smaller</li><li>High-realm cultivators&#39; quality declines (because the selectable range is small)</li><li>Bottom beings lose hope, civilization vitality declines</li><li>Eventually civilization stagnates and retreats</li></ul><p>The pre-Anchor era&#39;s sect system is this mode — top sects monopolize cultivation methods, commoners have no door to enter. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s &quot;Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System&quot; (Document 08) is precisely correction of this root.</p><h2 id="iii-predation-inflation-decline" tabindex="-1">III. Predation-Inflation Decline <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-predation-inflation-decline" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Predation-Inflation Decline&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When the cultivation system is centered on predation, civilization looks strong on the surface, but the foundation is corroding:</p><ul><li>Predated energy carries original owner&#39;s will residual traces, requiring much effort to refine</li><li>The predated and their associated groups resist, raising civilization&#39;s external cost</li><li>Long-term reliance on predation causes own origin evolution ability to degrade</li><li>When breaking through to highest realms face the &quot;impure origin&quot; bottleneck</li></ul><p>This kind of civilization looks strong, but actually is eating old reserves — once predation targets are exhausted, civilization collapses. The anti-predation axiom (Document 04) is precisely the fundamental negation of this root.</p><h2 id="iv-ceiling-lock-decline" tabindex="-1">IV. Ceiling-Lock Decline <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-ceiling-lock-decline" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Ceiling-Lock Decline&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When the realm system sets an artificial upper limit (like Tang-Luo&#39;s fierce-realm ceiling), civilization after reaching the upper limit loses evolution direction. Strong ones no longer have higher pursuits, turning to involution and internal strife; civilization as a whole stagnates.</p><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s nine-realm + two-realm system (Multiverse, Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm), through the law-first axiom ensures the realm system is infinitely expandable, rooting out ceiling-lock decline from the source.</p><h2 id="v-karma-imbalance-decline" tabindex="-1">V. Karma-Imbalance Decline <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-karma-imbalance-decline" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Karma-Imbalance Decline&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When high-realm cultivators are not constrained by causal self-discipline, casually disturbing karma, ultimately when karma bursts, civilization suffers catastrophic blow. One unfiled cross-plane interference may trigger chain reactions, causing the entire plane chain to collapse.</p><p>The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s causal self-discipline axiom and Alaya Network monitoring mechanism are precisely institutional prevention of this root.</p><h2 id="vi-historical-correction-mechanisms" tabindex="-1">VI. Historical Correction Mechanisms <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-historical-correction-mechanisms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Historical Correction Mechanisms&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization has built systematic historical correction mechanisms:</p><h3 id="_6-1-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review" tabindex="-1">6.1 Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review <a class="header-anchor" href="#_6-1-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;6.1 Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Putting historical civilizational decline cases into the Quest Sediment Domain (dual-track time domain) for simulated review, finding the key nodes of decline and correction plans. These review results feed back to real civilization, preventing repeating the same mistakes.</p><h3 id="_6-2-everyone-has-a-road-guarantee-system" tabindex="-1">6.2 Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System <a class="header-anchor" href="#_6-2-everyone-has-a-road-guarantee-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;6.2 Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Institutionally ensuring the bottom has advancement channels, rooting out class-solidification decline.</p><h3 id="_6-3-anti-predation-committee" tabindex="-1">6.3 Anti-Predation Committee <a class="header-anchor" href="#_6-3-anti-predation-committee" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;6.3 Anti-Predation Committee&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Specialized in supervising and investigating predatory behavior, timely discovering and correcting signs of predation-inflation decline.</p><h3 id="_6-4-20-activation-strategy" tabindex="-1">6.4 20% Activation Strategy <a class="header-anchor" href="#_6-4-20-activation-strategy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;6.4 20% Activation Strategy&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Through batch cultivation of Origin Realm strong ones, building a large enough strong-one group, preventing ceiling-lock decline.</p><h3 id="_6-5-causal-self-discipline-system" tabindex="-1">6.5 Causal Self-Discipline System <a class="header-anchor" href="#_6-5-causal-self-discipline-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;6.5 Causal Self-Discipline System&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Alaya Network monitors high-realm operations throughout, rooting out karma-imbalance decline.</p><h2 id="vii-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VII. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: historical correction avoids the enormous waste of &quot;repeating the same mistakes&quot; — every decline case&#39;s lesson is converted into civilization progress experience</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: historical correction&#39;s core is correcting predationism&#39;s roots</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems themselves are a typical case of ceiling-lock decline</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: historical correction mechanisms are open to every Myriad Races group, each race&#39;s historical experience is reviewed and learned</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain simulation review results are all open, providing reference for higher-dimensional civilization development</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The relationship between realm and history is not &quot;the stronger the better history,&quot; but &quot;whether the realm system is healthy determines civilization&#39;s historical trajectory.&quot; A cultivation system if causing class solidification, predation inflation, ceiling lock, or karma imbalance, civilization will decline; conversely, if the system is open, anti-predation, expandable, causally self-disciplined, civilization will continuously ascend. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s historical correction mechanisms are the institutional guarantee ensuring civilization never declines.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./71-前锚点时代.html">71-Pre-Anchor Era</a> · <a href="./72-锚点觉醒纪元.html">72-Anchor Awakening Epoch</a> · <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',40)])])}const p=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{u as __pageData,p as default};
